{
    "title": "HOF Bets: Make Smarter Bets",
    "description": "Hall of Fame Bets is the sports betting research app for player props and parlays. Research NFL and CFB (NCAAF) bets this season with the best football stats tool on the market.\r\n\r\nHOF Bets helps you find intelligent, +EV, outlier player props and parlay bets using advanced player prop data analytics and data visualization. Our tools are used by prop bettors of all kinds, from casual fans to betting pros.\r\n\r\nDownload now and join 100,000+ users finding outlier player props and parlays the smart way.\r\n\r\nHall of Fame Bets currently offers stats for 13 different sports leagues:\r\n- NFL\r\n- CFB / NCAAF\r\n- MLB\r\n- NBA\r\n- CBB / NCAAB\r\n- NHL\r\n- Soccer (Champions League, Premier League, MLS, LaLiga, Bundesliga, Ligue 1, Serie A)\r\n\r\nSubscription includes access to our Discord community. Come chat with fellow users, strategic bettors, and the HOF Bets team about daily plays and betting strategies. We run frequent giveaways and community events. Get fast, friendly support when you need it.\r\n\r\nHere\u2019s how HOF Bets works:\r\n\r\nHOME\r\nKick off your daily research process with a centralized dashboard where you can view upcoming games and browse outlier props you might be interested in.\r\n\r\nPARLAY OPTIMIZER\r\nView analytics and probabilities for any parlay, broken down by leg. Get hit rates, implied odds, and edge percentages to understand which props have good value and which ones to avoid. Identify weak legs and weed them out quickly. Use betslip integration to place your bets at your sportsbook of choice in just one click.\r\n\r\nDEEP STATS\r\nResearch player props in depth. Look up any player or team to view dynamic charts, game logs, matchup strength data, recent opponent performance data, and more. Toggle between different time spans and apply filters such as Head-to-Head, Home/Away, With/Without Teammates, Opponent Strength, vs Division/Conference, and more.\r\n\r\nLEADERBOARDS\r\nDiscover the hottest and most consistent players with hit rate rankings for any stat, along with odds and matchup grades for each player prop. See which players have recorded the best statlines in recent games or in head-to-head matchups versus the upcoming opponent. Understand which teams are in form and which teams are liabilities using game line rankings for moneylines, spreads, totals, and beyond.\r\n\r\nTRENDS\r\nBrowse all available props sorted by highest edge vs book odds to find the optimal props which stand out as outliers. Edge is calculated based on historical hit rate and can help us find +EV bets. Filter by stat, game, over/under, odds, hit rate, and more.\r\n\r\nDISCLOSURE\r\nAll data and gambling related content in the app is for entertainment purposes only and is not gambling advice or financial advice. This platform is intended for adult users only. If you or someone you know has a gambling problem and wants help, call 1-800-GAMBLER. Hall of Fame Bets is not a sportsbook and does not accept wagers or real-money deposits.\r\n\r\n\r\nHall of Fame Bets is a subscription service which costs $19.99/month or $119.99/year. Payment will be charged to iTunes account upon purchase and auto-renews at the same price unless deactivated in iTunes Account Settings.\r\n\r\nABOUT US\r\n\r\nHall of Fame Bets was started by two lifelong sports fans and Ivy League graduates with the goal of making sports betting research easier, with a particular focus on parlays. We are a small team of software developers and sports lovers passionate about helping our users achieve optimal sports betting outcomes.\r\n\r\nJoin 100,000+ total social media followers across Twitter (@hofbets), Instagram (@hof.bets), TikTok (@hofbets), and Discord (subscribe for access) to stay up to date.\r\n\r\nWe offer quick and professional customer service. If you have any questions or want to get in touch, message us on social media or email us at support@hofbets.com.\r\n\r\nWe are constantly working to improve our platform by adding more sports and introducing new features to make your research experience better.\r\n\r\nDownload the HOF Bets App today to start researching player props and parlays!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Hall of Fame Bets is the sports betting research app for player props and parlays. Research NFL and CFB (NCAAF) bets this season with the best football stats tool on the market.<br><br>HOF Bets helps you find intelligent, +EV, outlier player props and parlay bets using advanced player prop data analytics and data visualization. Our tools are used by prop bettors of all kinds, from casual fans to betting pros.<br><br>Download now and join 100,000+ users finding outlier player props and parlays the smart way.<br><br>Hall of Fame Bets currently offers stats for 13 different sports leagues:<br>- NFL<br>- CFB / NCAAF<br>- MLB<br>- NBA<br>- CBB / NCAAB<br>- NHL<br>- Soccer (Champions League, Premier League, MLS, LaLiga, Bundesliga, Ligue 1, Serie A)<br><br>Subscription includes access to our Discord community. Come chat with fellow users, strategic bettors, and the HOF Bets team about daily plays and betting strategies. We run frequent giveaways and community events. Get fast, friendly support when you need it.<br><br>Here\u2019s how HOF Bets works:<br><br>HOME<br>Kick off your daily research process with a centralized dashboard where you can view upcoming games and browse outlier props you might be interested in.<br><br>PARLAY OPTIMIZER<br>View analytics and probabilities for any parlay, broken down by leg. Get hit rates, implied odds, and edge percentages to understand which props have good value and which ones to avoid. Identify weak legs and weed them out quickly. Use betslip integration to place your bets at your sportsbook of choice in just one click.<br><br>DEEP STATS<br>Research player props in depth. Look up any player or team to view dynamic charts, game logs, matchup strength data, recent opponent performance data, and more. Toggle between different time spans and apply filters such as Head-to-Head, Home/Away, With/Without Teammates, Opponent Strength, vs Division/Conference, and more.<br><br>LEADERBOARDS<br>Discover the hottest and most